 "summary": "The new half-plane chart-change lemmas, the within-set left-inverse derivative lemma and the bordered atlas transfer have no existing counterpart: the nearest results (`comp_contDiffOn_halfPlane`, `contDiffOn_clm_apply`, `fderiv_comp_fderiv_eq_id_of_invOn`) need open sets, and `memWkpLoc_comp_bordered_transition` only covers holomorphic charts with k \u2264 1. The proofs reuse the existing reflection extension, open-set Sobolev results, `coord_eq_coordChangeL_coord`, `memWkpLoc_halfCoord` and `exists_wkp_upperHalf` rather than re-deriving them.",
